I'll make a few suggestions:

Get the AoLS; it's a good insurance policy. Save the rest of
the wishes. You may need another AoLS or some other important
item. 

If you're not going for a conduct game and you have't 
genocided "L" and ";", 2 blessed scrolls of genocide could
make the rest of your journey a lot safer and easier.

The time for nurse dancing is long past.

If you have the Charm Monster spell, it seems to work nicely
when engulfed by the Air Elementals. Them guys is tough. Try
to avoid them as much as possible. Fast, stealthy, and invisible
or displaced are all good attributes to have on the Plane of Air. 

Don't arrive on the Astral Plane weaing a ring of conflict. You
may decide later to put one on, but wait til you get there.

If you get to the Astral Plane with leftover wishes, a blessed
cockatrice corpse can help clear out the place in a hurry. Don't
try it on the riders, though. Also be VERY careful while wielding
it. Levitating is not a bad idea.

Someone suggested using a scroll of earth on the Astral Plane:
from what I've read here, that won't work. Don't depend on it.

Hope this helps. Good luck.

